<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements for the NeonBench binary.

  Deliberately empty: NeonBench claims NO special entitlements. It binds a
  listener on 127.0.0.1, reads and writes its own data directory, and opens
  the user's browser. None of that needs an entitlement, and every entry
  added here is an exception carved out of the hardened runtime that Apple's
  notary service — and anyone reading this file — is entitled to ask about.

  If a future change needs one (JIT, unsigned executable memory, loading
  third-party plug-ins, camera/microphone), add it here WITH a comment saying
  which feature requires it. An unexplained entitlement is a security smell.
-->
